    {"en": "Whoa! The village has never seen style like this.", "fr": "Wow! Le village n’a jamais vu un style pareil."},
    {"en": "Bold choice. The pond frogs are impressed.", "fr": "Choix audacieux. Les grenouilles de l’étang sont impressionnées."},
    {"en": "New look, same hero. Mostly.", "fr": "Nouveau style, même personnage. Ou presque."},
    {"en": "Is that what the cool pixels are wearing now?", "fr": "C’est ça que portent les pixels à la mode?"},
